			"strokeColor": "#f0883e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "2. add_argument()\n\nDefines what the CLI accepts.\nparser.add_argument(\"--input\",\n    default=\"file.json\",\n    help=\"Input file\")\n→ Sets name, default, help text\n→ Does NOT read input yet\n→ Only defines rules",
